# Real-world notes for the M0 gate (Croatian-first, a few English). Written as people actually type: no diacritics sometimes,
# relations instead of names, dates in every format, brands, phone numbers. NOW in the harness is 2026-08-25 (Tuesday).
# Fields: text · expected{intent, triggers (types that MUST be present), needs_anchor} · acceptable_questions (substrings; [] = any question is a miss)
#         · anchors (already known) · search_query (how you'd look for it 6 months later) · answer (correct option, if an options question is expected)
# Location-type triggers are dropped by ingest() until geocoding lands (M5), so location notes expect "semantic" only.

